(1778094, 242846, 44407, '<td valign="top">this is very cool</td>', 'this is very cool', '2005-10-12 01:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778114, 243083, 13026, '<td valign="top">It''s perfect.  I love it.  Even without more contrast and bluer tones.  :)</td>', 'It''s perfect.  I love it.  Even without more contrast and bluer tones.  :)', '2005-10-12 01:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778117, 241439, 14986, '<td valign="top">Finally...someone that GOT it.   I''m just rushing through the thumbnails, but I''m glad to see at least someone who understood it the same way I did.  <br/> <br/>Nice exposure on this as well and composition.  It does, indeed, look "tired", with the wear and tear both in the surroundings and the the wear on the bike.  I think you did a good job.  I hope you score well.</td>', 'Finally...someone that GOT it.   I''m just rushing through the thumbnails, but I''m glad to see at least someone who understood it the same way I did.   Nice exposure on this as well and composition.  It does, indeed, look "tired", with the wear and tear both in the surroundings and the the wear on the bike.  I think you did a good job.  I hope you score well.', '2005-10-12 01:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778129, 240860, 44407, '<td valign="top">this is so wrong 7</td>', 'this is so wrong 7', '2005-10-12 01:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778159, 241090, 39381, '<td valign="top">Excellent(especially with the title)..wish I''d thought of it..:-)</td>', 'Excellent(especially with the title)..wish I''d thought of it..:-)', '2005-10-12 01:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778160, 242870, 36462, '<td valign="top">great idea.  very creative.  would have liked to have seen greater dof.</td>', 'great idea.  very creative.  would have liked to have seen greater dof.', '2005-10-12 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778169, 241993, 45194, '<td valign="top">Not an amazing photo but MAN you put some time into this. It has to be worth a 6 - very creative!</td>', 'Not an amazing photo but MAN you put some time into this. It has to be worth a 6 - very creative!', '2005-10-12 01:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778171, 242982, 41522, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I have to say that I''m not a big fan of this pic.  I feel that the lighting is very strong, with a fairly bright area along the top of the image that is distracting for me.  The gull along the left edge that has been cut off by the crop is also a distraction and leads the eye out of the photo, IMO.  My personal preference would have been to have had a littl more DOF.  I searched for quite some time to find the focused gulls.  JMO.</td>', 'Sorry, I have to say that I''m not a big fan of this pic.  I feel that the lighting is very strong, with a fairly bright area along the top of the image that is distracting for me.  The gull along the left edge that has been cut off by the crop is also a distraction and leads the eye out of the photo, IMO.  My personal preference would have been to have had a littl more DOF.  I searched for quite some time to find the focused gulls.  JMO.', '2005-10-12 01:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778173, 241982, 45194, '<td valign="top">Great title!  Worth 7!</td>', 'Great title!  Worth 7!', '2005-10-12 01:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778176, 240860, 45000, '<td valign="top">Hahahahha....ahhhh...HAHAHAHAHAHA....ahhhhhhh, yeah...that''s quality.<br/> <br/>I''m still laughing...</td>', 'Hahahahha....ahhhh...HAHAHAHAHAHA....ahhhhhhh, yeah...that''s quality. I''m still laughing...', '2005-10-12 01:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778177, 243023, 6519, '<td valign="top">Superb!!!!!! Brilliant grasp of the challenge concept. You truly got some emotion across here, well done!</td>', 'Superb!!!!!! Brilliant grasp of the challenge concept. You truly got some emotion across here, well done!', '2005-10-12 01:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778178, 241373, 36299, '<td valign="top">Very nice representation.  Not much you can do with the background with basic editting.  The sun throws the image off kilter since no other focus point is in the rule of thirds to balance this out.  A slightly different crop may of helped, but a different angle for the same photo with this in mind would eliminated this problem for me. 7.</td>', 'Very nice representation.  Not much you can do with the background with basic editting.  The sun throws the image off kilter since no other focus point is in the rule of thirds to balance this out.  A slightly different crop may of helped, but a different angle for the same photo with this in mind would eliminated this problem for me. 7.', '2005-10-12 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1778179, 242700, 45404, '<td valign="top">I love it, I don''t know why ;)</td>', 'I love it, I don''t know why ;)', '2005-10-12 01:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
