(1778572, 243002, 9809, '<td valign="top">Excellent. One of the few photos I''ve seen so far that actually got the concept, as I understood it. Not only have you captured the subject of the challenge, but you''ve done it quite well. Lighting is spot on. Sharpness is spot on. I would be interested in seeing your other shots of this one. Some with the branch slightly turned to the right, maybe a few at a tilt. You might have picked the best, but I see possibilities. Still earns a rare 10 from me though. This is 1 of 2 favorites in this challenge so far -- and after seeing all the other photos, the only 10. Good luck and I expect a ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent. One of the few photos I''ve seen so far that actually got the concept, as I understood it. Not only have you captured the subject of the challenge, but you''ve done it quite well. Lighting is spot on. Sharpness is spot on. I would be interested in seeing your other shots of this one. Some with the branch slightly turned to the right, maybe a few at a tilt. You might have picked the best, but I see possibilities. Still earns a rare 10 from me though. This is 1 of 2 favorites in this challenge so far -- and after seeing all the other photos, the only 10. Good luck and I expect a ribbon.', '2005-10-12 02:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
