(1779164, 242974, 15711, '<td valign="top">How in the world did you stand up that many bananas???? Great idea.  Out of focus though. I think the extra white border detracts and makes the background look too gray. I think a solid black would have suited it better. I like the leading line of it and the clever imagination.</td>', 'How in the world did you stand up that many bananas???? Great idea.  Out of focus though. I think the extra white border detracts and makes the background look too gray. I think a solid black would have suited it better. I like the leading line of it and the clever imagination.', '2005-10-12 10:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779166, 242882, 16241, '<td valign="top">moody shot, good pp.</td>', 'moody shot, good pp.', '2005-10-12 10:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
