(1779172, 242107, 15711, '<td valign="top">GREAT!! This is the best of the lot.  Super lens flare too.  Great coloration and light (no pun intended) Well achieved for sure 10 10 10</td>', 'GREAT!! This is the best of the lot.  Super lens flare too.  Great coloration and light (no pun intended) Well achieved for sure 10 10 10', '2005-10-12 10:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
