(1779176, 242536, 45047, '<td valign="top">This I like. The bottles are looking almost perfect. The things that should be dark are and the colour of the sky is just beautiful, not to mention the horizon.</td>', 'This I like. The bottles are looking almost perfect. The things that should be dark are and the colour of the sky is just beautiful, not to mention the horizon.', '2005-10-12 10:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779179, 243158, 15711, '<td valign="top">Sorry, this doesn''t meet the challenge, it''s dead centered like a bullseye and it''s just not interesting.  If you want a crucifix such as this to work, put it against a solid black background, and use a directional light to illuminate it in an interesting fashion. The red of the frame is distracting as well. Not meaning to sound rude , but this just doesn''t have much going for it.  I apologize for my bluntness, but people with low scores want to be told why, so I''m stepping out and doing just that.  Good luck next time.</td>', 'Sorry, this doesn''t meet the challenge, it''s dead centered like a bullseye and it''s just not interesting.  If you want a crucifix such as this to work, put it against a solid black background, and use a directional light to illuminate it in an interesting fashion. The red of the frame is distracting as well. Not meaning to sound rude , but this just doesn''t have much going for it.  I apologize for my bluntness, but people with low scores want to be told why, so I''m stepping out and doing just that.  Good luck next time.', '2005-10-12 10:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1779180, 243026, 45047, '<td valign="top">I also tried to get a few shots like this, but didn''t manage to get any that would be worth submission, so I didn''t enter in this challenge. This picture meets the idea in my head. Great job!</td>', 'I also tried to get a few shots like this, but didn''t manage to get any that would be worth submission, so I didn''t enter in this challenge. This picture meets the idea in my head. Great job!', '2005-10-12 10:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
