(1779182, 241025, 24013, '<td valign="top">twin dogs on hind legs leaning on their owner begging for food...i hope.  or full frontal.  great find!  i might have shot it at another time of day and cropped off the sides a bit.</td>', 'twin dogs on hind legs leaning on their owner begging for food...i hope.  or full frontal.  great find!  i might have shot it at another time of day and cropped off the sides a bit.', '2005-10-12 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
