(1781980, 243023, 45343, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and taken.  You make good decisions - The lamp selections were perfect.  I love the blue lightbulb in the little guy.   I was wondering how to make it less stark.  Perhaps a softer background or a table cloth? *shrug*</td>', 'Very nicely composed and taken.  You make good decisions - The lamp selections were perfect.  I love the blue lightbulb in the little guy.   I was wondering how to make it less stark.  Perhaps a softer background or a table cloth? *shrug*', '2005-10-13 12:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1781991, 241342, 45343, '<td valign="top">A wonderfuly captured human trait.  The addition of the wood shaving helps illustrate your good DoF selection.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'A wonderfuly captured human trait.  The addition of the wood shaving helps illustrate your good DoF selection.  One of my favorites.', '2005-10-13 12:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
