(1782002, 243068, 45343, '<td valign="top">looked more like a suicide attempt.   "If any one comes closer I''ll jump!!"  Poor guy was only half (and half) there.  Anyway...  Very nice contrast and use of shadow.  Creates a dark mood.  I am a little distracted by the clutter but you should see my fridge.</td>', 'looked more like a suicide attempt.   "If any one comes closer I''ll jump!!"  Poor guy was only half (and half) there.  Anyway...  Very nice contrast and use of shadow.  Creates a dark mood.  I am a little distracted by the clutter but you should see my fridge.', '2005-10-13 13:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
