(1782236, 241982, 40718, '<td valign="top">Aw, I would have given this a 10 for such excellent use of personification (without it being "human-looking"), but the picture has some technical issues.  I don''t like the blow out highlight and the amount of color noise.  Still, an 8 because I like the creativity.</td>', 'Aw, I would have given this a 10 for such excellent use of personification (without it being "human-looking"), but the picture has some technical issues.  I don''t like the blow out highlight and the amount of color noise.  Still, an 8 because I like the creativity.', '2005-10-13 15:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782237, 242705, 3569, '<td valign="top">water must have gotten on my brain, I see nothing here.</td>', 'water must have gotten on my brain, I see nothing here.', '2005-10-13 15:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782240, 242593, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  Maybe a little overexposed?  Would have like to see richer tones in the grass.  The challenge is met well.  I''m ignoring the whole "does a plant qualify as inanimate" debate and just allowing it on all pictures.  8</td>', 'Nice picture.  Maybe a little overexposed?  Would have like to see richer tones in the grass.  The challenge is met well.  I''m ignoring the whole "does a plant qualify as inanimate" debate and just allowing it on all pictures.  8', '2005-10-13 15:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
