(1782245, 242460, 40718, '<td valign="top">Nice creativity.  It seems like bananas and desk lamps have the most personality among inanimate objects.  The picture has some technical problems which keep it from a higher score (gave it an 8).  The dead banana is OOF which I think detracts as it is such a major subject.  It also has blown highlights.  Otherwise, well done.</td>', 'Nice creativity.  It seems like bananas and desk lamps have the most personality among inanimate objects.  The picture has some technical problems which keep it from a higher score (gave it an 8).  The dead banana is OOF which I think detracts as it is such a major subject.  It also has blown highlights.  Otherwise, well done.', '2005-10-13 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782248, 242369, 3569, '<td valign="top">wow a new plaid, what clan is this?</td>', 'wow a new plaid, what clan is this?', '2005-10-13 15:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1782249, 241127, 40718, '<td valign="top">I thought there would be more Solitude pictures as it seems an easy thing to do.  This is well done.  Some techincal stuff kept it from a top score, but I gave it an 8.  The sky has issues as well as the blown highlight on the lake.  The duotone works.</td>', 'I thought there would be more Solitude pictures as it seems an easy thing to do.  This is well done.  Some techincal stuff kept it from a top score, but I gave it an 8.  The sky has issues as well as the blown highlight on the lake.  The duotone works.', '2005-10-13 15:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
