(1782255, 241342, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think the limited DOF works in this picture.  The use of personification is excellent and what I imagined the challenge was really trying to get at.  The busy background helps the picture be more interesting vs. having no refuse.  The clarity of the nailhead keeps it from getting lost in the clutter.  8</td>', 'I think the limited DOF works in this picture.  The use of personification is excellent and what I imagined the challenge was really trying to get at.  The busy background helps the picture be more interesting vs. having no refuse.  The clarity of the nailhead keeps it from getting lost in the clutter.  8', '2005-10-13 15:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
