(1782750, 242308, 40718, '<td valign="top">As far as faces go, it does capture "happy".  I like a title with an adjective instead of just "face".  The technicals are good. 6</td>', 'As far as faces go, it does capture "happy".  I like a title with an adjective instead of just "face".  The technicals are good. 6', '2005-10-13 20:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
