(1783824, 243103, 34192, '<td valign="top">While an interesting take on the challenge, I think the lighting hurts this image.  The composition is great, the DOF works.</td>', 'While an interesting take on the challenge, I think the lighting hurts this image.  The composition is great, the DOF works.', '2005-10-14 11:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783825, 242882, 34192, '<td valign="top">Not sure I understand the composition of this image but I really love the tones used.</td>', 'Not sure I understand the composition of this image but I really love the tones used.', '2005-10-14 11:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783828, 242949, 34192, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, statues are imitation rather than personification.  I like the composition.  The DOF works very well.  Kinda creeped out by the snail in her ear but not considering it in voting.</td>', 'In my opinion, statues are imitation rather than personification.  I like the composition.  The DOF works very well.  Kinda creeped out by the snail in her ear but not considering it in voting.', '2005-10-14 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783831, 242856, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, statues are imitation rather than personification.  Interesting composition and POV.</td>', 'For me, statues are imitation rather than personification.  Interesting composition and POV.', '2005-10-14 11:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783834, 241452, 34192, '<td valign="top">For me, statues are imitation rather than personification. Non-the-less, really like the composition and the point the view.  The tones are great and depth of field works really well for me.</td>', 'For me, statues are imitation rather than personification. Non-the-less, really like the composition and the point the view.  The tones are great and depth of field works really well for me.', '2005-10-14 11:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783848, 242821, 42332, '<td valign="top">hahaha!!! i am quite amused.</td>', 'hahaha!!! i am quite amused.', '2005-10-14 11:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783928, 241443, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a nice picture and I''ll buy it for personification.  I might have tried to fiddle with the contrast of the sky, but you were probably quite limited in basic.  6</td>', 'I think it''s a nice picture and I''ll buy it for personification.  I might have tried to fiddle with the contrast of the sky, but you were probably quite limited in basic.  6', '2005-10-14 12:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783931, 241901, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think you understood the challenge, which is saying a bit with this one.  I''m going to ignore the "are plants inanimate" debate and just allow it.  This is one where I get the feeling AFTER I read the title, which isn''t as good as getting it BEFORE, but better than not getting it at all.  The technicals aren''t bad.  I might have lowered the contrast a tad so as to bring more detail in the black patch out while not blowing out the white highlights. 6</td>', 'I think you understood the challenge, which is saying a bit with this one.  I''m going to ignore the "are plants inanimate" debate and just allow it.  This is one where I get the feeling AFTER I read the title, which isn''t as good as getting it BEFORE, but better than not getting it at all.  The technicals aren''t bad.  I might have lowered the contrast a tad so as to bring more detail in the black patch out while not blowing out the white highlights. 6', '2005-10-14 12:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783933, 242618, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a creative idea.  The personification would have been hit harder if the title directly stated the gloves were praying, but that''s small.  There are some technical issues.  A) There''s a color cast (if that paper is white)  B) What''s up with the corner?  C) It''s noisy.  I''ll still give you a 6</td>', 'I think it''s a creative idea.  The personification would have been hit harder if the title directly stated the gloves were praying, but that''s small.  There are some technical issues.  A) There''s a color cast (if that paper is white)  B) What''s up with the corner?  C) It''s noisy.  I''ll still give you a 6', '2005-10-14 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783935, 243020, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  The lighting is good.  Couldn''t you have had her swinging on a pole or something? (just kidding).  6</td>', 'Cute idea.  The lighting is good.  Couldn''t you have had her swinging on a pole or something? (just kidding).  6', '2005-10-14 12:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783947, 242833, 40718, '<td valign="top">Excellent literary use of personification with the title.  The picture is one in which the title is necessary, but that''s not completely bad.  I do like the sky, although I''ve learned that sky pictures, even sunsets, do better if they have a foreground subject.  6</td>', 'Excellent literary use of personification with the title.  The picture is one in which the title is necessary, but that''s not completely bad.  I do like the sky, although I''ve learned that sky pictures, even sunsets, do better if they have a foreground subject.  6', '2005-10-14 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783948, 241090, 40718, '<td valign="top">It''s a cute face and a nice play on words.  The picture, by itself, isn''t too exciting.  The highlights are blown, but I think that isn''t a big problem with this shot.  6</td>', 'It''s a cute face and a nice play on words.  The picture, by itself, isn''t too exciting.  The highlights are blown, but I think that isn''t a big problem with this shot.  6', '2005-10-14 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783949, 240722, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m not too fond of the constructed entries, but I really like the gradient colors you have.  Being on the mirror obviously was necessary for the lighting, but maybe detracts from your subject with the duplication.  6</td>', 'I''m not too fond of the constructed entries, but I really like the gradient colors you have.  Being on the mirror obviously was necessary for the lighting, but maybe detracts from your subject with the duplication.  6', '2005-10-14 12:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783953, 243159, 40718, '<td valign="top">I had this as a 6, but on second thought I''m bumping to a 7.  The best entries convey the feeling before the title is read, this is one that manages that.  I can see dejected easily.  The composition is nice and the black is nice and rich.  I personally like the border, but know some people like to comment on such things. 7</td>', 'I had this as a 6, but on second thought I''m bumping to a 7.  The best entries convey the feeling before the title is read, this is one that manages that.  I can see dejected easily.  The composition is nice and the black is nice and rich.  I personally like the border, but know some people like to comment on such things. 7', '2005-10-14 12:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783954, 243032, 40718, '<td valign="top">I see the face, I like the lime versus the red, but I don''t get any other strong feelings about this one.  6</td>', 'I see the face, I like the lime versus the red, but I don''t get any other strong feelings about this one.  6', '2005-10-14 12:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1783957, 242687, 40718, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  It took me a moment to put the knife together with the "last kiss" part.  At first the "candle light" made me think romantic, but I see now it''s an execution. 6</td>', 'Cute idea.  It took me a moment to put the knife together with the "last kiss" part.  At first the "candle light" made me think romantic, but I see now it''s an execution. 6', '2005-10-14 12:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784005, 243026, 40295, '<td valign="top">The concept is good and  the title fits - but I think it would have looked better with a stronger shaft of light.</td>', 'The concept is good and  the title fits - but I think it would have looked better with a stronger shaft of light.', '2005-10-14 13:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784007, 242987, 40718, '<td valign="top">I think this challenge has a lot to do with the title.  Had you just called it "lonely warrior" I wouldn''t like it.  But the "guarding" is the personification.  It''s a cute construct, although I prefer the entries which are not constructed.  6</td>', 'I think this challenge has a lot to do with the title.  Had you just called it "lonely warrior" I wouldn''t like it.  But the "guarding" is the personification.  It''s a cute construct, although I prefer the entries which are not constructed.  6', '2005-10-14 13:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784009, 243005, 40718, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  Does the model look OOF to you?  Her face seems to be.  It''s too bad the sky had to be blown or overcast, perhaps a different time of day would have helped. 6</td>', 'I like the idea.  Does the model look OOF to you?  Her face seems to be.  It''s too bad the sky had to be blown or overcast, perhaps a different time of day would have helped. 6', '2005-10-14 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784010, 242299, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is one where you need the title to convey the idea.  Once read though, the picture is understood (not all are even getting that far).  The contrast of the colors works well. 6</td>', 'This is one where you need the title to convey the idea.  Once read though, the picture is understood (not all are even getting that far).  The contrast of the colors works well. 6', '2005-10-14 13:12:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784011, 242846, 36462, '<td valign="top">The fern is distracting covering up part of the stump face  like that.</td>', 'The fern is distracting covering up part of the stump face  like that.', '2005-10-14 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784012, 242974, 40295, '<td valign="top">Good Idea and well implemented however I don''t get what IMHO is strong enough feeling of disapproval. Also the highlights are a bit blown out on the green bannanas. So a little more work on the lighing would have helped.</td>', 'Good Idea and well implemented however I don''t get what IMHO is strong enough feeling of disapproval. Also the highlights are a bit blown out on the green bannanas. So a little more work on the lighing would have helped.', '2005-10-14 13:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784014, 242870, 40295, '<td valign="top">Simple and well done for the challenge - I would have prefered more DOF - especially on the "tounge"</td>', 'Simple and well done for the challenge - I would have prefered more DOF - especially on the "tounge"', '2005-10-14 13:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784015, 243005, 40295, '<td valign="top">Even with a person  in the image it fits the challenge well. Sharpness could have been better and the background hurst a bit. A slightly different angle to get the pole on the left and and the shed(?) on the right out of the image would have helped.</td>', 'Even with a person  in the image it fits the challenge well. Sharpness could have been better and the background hurst a bit. A slightly different angle to get the pole on the left and and the shed(?) on the right out of the image would have helped.', '2005-10-14 13:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784018, 241745, 40295, '<td valign="top">This might be more a matter of personal taste, but I would have cropped some off of the bottom of the image.</td>', 'This might be more a matter of personal taste, but I would have cropped some off of the bottom of the image.', '2005-10-14 13:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784020, 243147, 40295, '<td valign="top">Adding a bib to the settup would have been a good added touch.</td>', 'Adding a bib to the settup would have been a good added touch.', '2005-10-14 13:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784022, 242679, 40295, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit of a distraction to me - especially the highlight at the base.</td>', 'The background is a bit of a distraction to me - especially the highlight at the base.', '2005-10-14 13:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784025, 242980, 40295, '<td valign="top">Good idea - I would have like to have seen more that the top - to move the flower down a bit more from the top of the image.</td>', 'Good idea - I would have like to have seen more that the top - to move the flower down a bit more from the top of the image.', '2005-10-14 13:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784027, 242687, 40295, '<td valign="top">A more even background lighting woud have looked better to me.</td>', 'A more even background lighting woud have looked better to me.', '2005-10-14 13:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784033, 241342, 40295, '<td valign="top">You got the concept across, but I think focusing more on the bend in the nail rather than the head of the nail would strengthen the idea.</td>', 'You got the concept across, but I think focusing more on the bend in the nail rather than the head of the nail would strengthen the idea.', '2005-10-14 13:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784059, 241002, 38234, '<td valign="top">great idea</td>', 'great idea', '2005-10-14 13:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784062, 243023, 38234, '<td valign="top">one of my top 4 favourites!!  really well conceived and shot!!</td>', 'one of my top 4 favourites!!  really well conceived and shot!!', '2005-10-14 13:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784063, 243002, 38234, '<td valign="top">beautifully done and so femiine and graceful looking!!</td>', 'beautifully done and so femiine and graceful looking!!', '2005-10-14 13:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784065, 242107, 38234, '<td valign="top">superbly done!!! in all respects</td>', 'superbly done!!! in all respects', '2005-10-14 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784068, 242726, 38234, '<td valign="top">i gave the highest marks to things without faces</td>', 'i gave the highest marks to things without faces', '2005-10-14 14:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784070, 242814, 38234, '<td valign="top">very nicely done</td>', 'very nicely done', '2005-10-14 14:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784075, 242758, 38234, '<td valign="top">I find this too blown out to personify anything</td>', 'I find this too blown out to personify anything', '2005-10-14 14:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784103, 241135, 43221, '<td valign="top">The grinner who has a lazy eye? ;-)<br/> <br/>ps: Could have benefited from a better angle and a better crop.</td>', 'The grinner who has a lazy eye? ;-) ps: Could have benefited from a better angle and a better crop.', '2005-10-14 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784121, 242381, 44275, '<td valign="top">This is a really interesting photoraphy. I like it.</td>', 'This is a really interesting photoraphy. I like it.', '2005-10-14 14:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784150, 242381, 45784, '<td valign="top">What I love about this photo (or smoke in general) is that I can see alot<br/>of monsters from Final Fantasy serial (PS game) in it. But that is individual<br/>of course :)<br/>Does look alive, doesn''t it? An easy shot, yet so nice. Smooth. Love it</td>', 'What I love about this photo (or smoke in general) is that I can see alotof monsters from Final Fantasy serial (PS game) in it. But that is individualof course :)Does look alive, doesn''t it? An easy shot, yet so nice. Smooth. Love it', '2005-10-14 14:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784159, 243023, 45784, '<td valign="top">I wonder what are they talking about... And what did the litle guy do wrong?<br/>Congratulations! Great idea.</td>', 'I wonder what are they talking about... And what did the litle guy do wrong?Congratulations! Great idea.', '2005-10-14 14:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784162, 243105, 45784, '<td valign="top">Hope it''s not your house she lives in:)<br/>The hair is a bit strange I think... And maybe a bit underexposed</td>', 'Hope it''s not your house she lives in:)The hair is a bit strange I think... And maybe a bit underexposed', '2005-10-14 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784164, 242758, 44627, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I think the photo needs more detail.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I think the photo needs more detail.', '2005-10-14 14:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784166, 242142, 45784, '<td valign="top">It is lovely and emotional. But a bit too easy and casual.<br/>I dunno, maybe that''s the point. Why spend alot of time composing the scene<br/>if there are simple ones that leave as good impresion.<br/>Maybe could''ve used more photoshop. Tiny bit too flat I think. Still very good.</td>', 'It is lovely and emotional. But a bit too easy and casual.I dunno, maybe that''s the point. Why spend alot of time composing the sceneif there are simple ones that leave as good impresion.Maybe could''ve used more photoshop. Tiny bit too flat I think. Still very good.', '2005-10-14 14:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784170, 242785, 45784, '<td valign="top">Ha-ha. What is that anyway? Wonder if you made it or bought it...</td>', 'Ha-ha. What is that anyway? Wonder if you made it or bought it...', '2005-10-14 14:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784173, 241369, 45784, '<td valign="top">I don''t see much personification. But it cought my eye</td>', 'I don''t see much personification. But it cought my eye', '2005-10-14 14:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784178, 243020, 45784, '<td valign="top">They really look real. And very interested in the show.</td>', 'They really look real. And very interested in the show.', '2005-10-14 14:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784181, 242882, 45784, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Maybe not enough convincing. I think you should have bent them even more. They would look more sad...if that was the idea. Great background</td>', 'Nice shot. Maybe not enough convincing. I think you should have bent them even more. They would look more sad...if that was the idea. Great background', '2005-10-14 14:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784185, 243168, 45784, '<td valign="top">This would look so much better if you have used some photoshop. Only levels or curves would do... that way the "face" would be pointed out much more.<br/>I love the scene. Gives sense of 3D. Like it''s looking upwards, and mouth pointed down. If you''ve done it on purpose, that''s a big plus for you.</td>', 'This would look so much better if you have used some photoshop. Only levels or curves would do... that way the "face" would be pointed out much more.I love the scene. Gives sense of 3D. Like it''s looking upwards, and mouth pointed down. If you''ve done it on purpose, that''s a big plus for you.', '2005-10-14 15:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784190, 242758, 45784, '<td valign="top">Ouch. Way too overexposed or done on purpose? If so, to get effect of what?<br/>I''m a bit confused, or maybe my imagination is too shalow.</td>', 'Ouch. Way too overexposed or done on purpose? If so, to get effect of what?I''m a bit confused, or maybe my imagination is too shalow.', '2005-10-14 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784192, 241752, 45784, '<td valign="top">Niceeee!!!</td>', 'Niceeee!!!', '2005-10-14 15:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784197, 241141, 45784, '<td valign="top">A dol looks more human than these humans.</td>', 'A dol looks more human than these humans.', '2005-10-14 15:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784211, 242102, 34763, '<td valign="top">excellent</td>', 'excellent', '2005-10-14 15:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784214, 242507, 45784, '<td valign="top">This is a really good one. I don''t know what this leaf is doing but sure looks<br/>like it''s doing something. Tiny light points in the back look like my town at night.<br/>I wonder what they are. If only your/friends arm wasn''t cought in motion.<br/>I''m rating it high. I would buy a print of it for my mom''s birthdate. I know she''d love it</td>', 'This is a really good one. I don''t know what this leaf is doing but sure lookslike it''s doing something. Tiny light points in the back look like my town at night.I wonder what they are. If only your/friends arm wasn''t cought in motion.I''m rating it high. I would buy a print of it for my mom''s birthdate. I know she''d love it', '2005-10-14 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784219, 240860, 45784, '<td valign="top">Great,great,great. You could have forced more levels for better effect.<br/>Darkening it up a little bit. You''ve got a great eye</td>', 'Great,great,great. You could have forced more levels for better effect.Darkening it up a little bit. You''ve got a great eye', '2005-10-14 15:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784223, 241439, 45784, '<td valign="top">broken doesn''t mean alive. And the scene is not so interestiong (to me).<br/>But I like the floor.</td>', 'broken doesn''t mean alive. And the scene is not so interestiong (to me).But I like the floor.', '2005-10-14 15:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784227, 242874, 45784, '<td valign="top">Simple, smooth, nice. Maybe you should have waited for another 10 minutes.<br/>Great</td>', 'Simple, smooth, nice. Maybe you should have waited for another 10 minutes.Great', '2005-10-14 15:21:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784229, 242413, 45784, '<td valign="top">Dunno about personification here, but I sure love it.</td>', 'Dunno about personification here, but I sure love it.', '2005-10-14 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784233, 242870, 45784, '<td valign="top">I''m new guy here so I don''t know much about rules on editing, but I think this one<br/>is not aceptable. I''ll give you a pure 10 couse I love the simplicity and the idea.<br/>Just hope it serves the rules.</td>', 'I''m new guy here so I don''t know much about rules on editing, but I think this oneis not aceptable. I''ll give you a pure 10 couse I love the simplicity and the idea.Just hope it serves the rules.', '2005-10-14 15:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
