(1784442, 242857, 30049, '<td valign="top">That would be my first thought also (Tin Soldiers).  Very good eye to see this one.  Looks like a military installtion somewhere.  So cool how they seem to go on forever - nice vanishing point!  I think the composition is fine - wonder what it would look like to take enough off the top to lose the bg trees, of course then you''d have to pinch the right a little.  Hmmm...nothing like armchair quarterbacking is there?  ;^)<br/> <br/>I''m going to hazard a guess for the fun of it ... Toddhead?  <br/> <br/>Edit to add post-result comments:<br/> <br/>Oops!  Wrong guess.  ;^)<br/> <br/>Thought this should have placed higher.  Oh well - on to the next one eh?.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-19 08:27:22.</i></td>', 'That would be my first thought also (Tin Soldiers).  Very good eye to see this one.  Looks like a military installtion somewhere.  So cool how they seem to go on forever - nice vanishing point!  I think the composition is fine - wonder what it would look like to take enough off the top to lose the bg trees, of course then you''d have to pinch the right a little.  Hmmm...nothing like armchair quarterbacking is there?  ;^) I''m going to hazard a guess for the fun of it ... Toddhead?   Edit to add post-result comments: Oops!  Wrong guess.  ;^) Thought this should have placed higher.  Oh well - on to the next one eh?.', '2005-10-14 17:19:11.000000', '2005-10-19 09:27:22.000000', 1),
