(1784521, 243032, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is funny (title especially), and a good piece of fruit for this shot.  The green background kills it for me.  I can see how you were using the ROT for positioning but you may have wanted to see what it looked like coming down or up a bit more - it''s close to centered.  The lighting is a bit dark on the left front of the fruit - a white piece of poster board or a white bedsheet could reflect some light into that area for you.  Gets a 4 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This is funny (title especially), and a good piece of fruit for this shot.  The green background kills it for me.  I can see how you were using the ROT for positioning but you may have wanted to see what it looked like coming down or up a bit more - it''s close to centered.  The lighting is a bit dark on the left front of the fruit - a white piece of poster board or a white bedsheet could reflect some light into that area for you.  Gets a 4 from me.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2005-10-14 17:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
