(1784612, 242814, 30777, '<td valign="top">Great, too bad about blowing out the backside of the white tack</td>', 'Great, too bad about blowing out the backside of the white tack', '2005-10-14 18:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784614, 242983, 30777, '<td valign="top">Needed a better title</td>', 'Needed a better title', '2005-10-14 18:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784663, 242968, 30055, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot, but it''s a little bit muddy/dark, and I feel the colors don''t POP as strongly as they could. Maybe a little more exposure next time. I like the limited depth of field.</td>', 'This is a nice shot, but it''s a little bit muddy/dark, and I feel the colors don''t POP as strongly as they could. Maybe a little more exposure next time. I like the limited depth of field.', '2005-10-14 19:19:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784671, 243100, 30055, '<td valign="top">I feel this shot has way too much negative space without really adding anything to the suject. A tighter composition could have lent some substance to an otherwise somewhat static shot. I also think the red light towards the bottom is distracting. Good effort though.</td>', 'I feel this shot has way too much negative space without really adding anything to the suject. A tighter composition could have lent some substance to an otherwise somewhat static shot. I also think the red light towards the bottom is distracting. Good effort though.', '2005-10-14 19:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784672, 242876, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can see the grandmother, but I don''t feel it does too much more for me.  The technicals aren''t too bad.  The dynamic range is well done.  5</td>', 'I can see the grandmother, but I don''t feel it does too much more for me.  The technicals aren''t too bad.  The dynamic range is well done.  5', '2005-10-14 19:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784678, 242783, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can see the face, but not much more.  These pictures fit the challenge on some level, but don''t get the high scores (in my opinion).  The focus and cropping are on though, which is good. 5</td>', 'I can see the face, but not much more.  These pictures fit the challenge on some level, but don''t get the high scores (in my opinion).  The focus and cropping are on though, which is good. 5', '2005-10-14 19:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784680, 241090, 43020, '<td valign="top">Clever title on a naturally nice balanced shot - this was made for the rule of thirds!  :)  I love the duplicity in the title - I think in some challenges it can mean the difference between a good score and a great score, your''s is the latter.</td>', 'Clever title on a naturally nice balanced shot - this was made for the rule of thirds!  :)  I love the duplicity in the title - I think in some challenges it can mean the difference between a good score and a great score, your''s is the latter.', '2005-10-14 19:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784686, 241672, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can''t really see the personification here.  (I had to look up the word...chess, I believe).  However, I think it''s technically and compositionally an excellent picture so I gave it a 5.</td>', 'I can''t really see the personification here.  (I had to look up the word...chess, I believe).  However, I think it''s technically and compositionally an excellent picture so I gave it a 5.', '2005-10-14 19:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784690, 243166, 40718, '<td valign="top">Salt is really hard to expose properly.  It looks blown to me with no detail.  I think the grains on the mirror are really interesting because you can see exactly where the DOF was. 5</td>', 'Salt is really hard to expose properly.  It looks blown to me with no detail.  I think the grains on the mirror are really interesting because you can see exactly where the DOF was. 5', '2005-10-14 19:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784692, 242390, 40718, '<td valign="top">I see the smirk which I think is reasonable as far as challenge met.  The composition leaves a bit to be desired.  Why is it crooked?  On purpose? if so, to what effect?  I think the leaves also detract and would have removed them.  The highlight on the hydrant is also unfortunate.</td>', 'I see the smirk which I think is reasonable as far as challenge met.  The composition leaves a bit to be desired.  Why is it crooked?  On purpose? if so, to what effect?  I think the leaves also detract and would have removed them.  The highlight on the hydrant is also unfortunate.', '2005-10-14 19:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784694, 241359, 40718, '<td valign="top">The OOF plug is a good compositional touch, but I''d rather not have the other plug which is already in.</td>', 'The OOF plug is a good compositional touch, but I''d rather not have the other plug which is already in.', '2005-10-14 19:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784695, 242983, 40718, '<td valign="top">Work on making your pictures bigger; as close to 640 pixels on one axis.  Those tend to do better in challenges.  That being said, it''s an interesting subject, although I''m not fond of the purely "physical" personifications.  I''d rather it have tried to capture an abstract or emotional concept.  "The plant, well endowed as he was, strutted around the forest like a bull in heat..."</td>', 'Work on making your pictures bigger; as close to 640 pixels on one axis.  Those tend to do better in challenges.  That being said, it''s an interesting subject, although I''m not fond of the purely "physical" personifications.  I''d rather it have tried to capture an abstract or emotional concept.  "The plant, well endowed as he was, strutted around the forest like a bull in heat..."', '2005-10-14 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784700, 243156, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can see the face, but it doesn''t do too much else for me.  The technicals are good (in focus, etc), the composition is slightly enhanced by the diagonals, but the overall image is unexciting because of the majority of bland bark areas. 5</td>', 'I can see the face, but it doesn''t do too much else for me.  The technicals are good (in focus, etc), the composition is slightly enhanced by the diagonals, but the overall image is unexciting because of the majority of bland bark areas. 5', '2005-10-14 19:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784704, 241528, 40718, '<td valign="top">Suffers from some technical problems.  The flowers seem slightly out of focus (worst on the left).  The choice of B&amp;W doesn''t add too much because so much detail is lost in the flowers.  I also don''t understand the significance of the frame.  Finally, the picture is crooked.  You did get the concept of personification though. 5</td>', 'Suffers from some technical problems.  The flowers seem slightly out of focus (worst on the left).  The choice of B&W doesn''t add too much because so much detail is lost in the flowers.  I also don''t understand the significance of the frame.  Finally, the picture is crooked.  You did get the concept of personification though. 5', '2005-10-14 19:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784706, 241775, 40718, '<td valign="top">I can see the face, but I don''t think it does too much more for me.  The upside down nature adds a little interest. 5</td>', 'I can see the face, but I don''t think it does too much more for me.  The upside down nature adds a little interest. 5', '2005-10-14 19:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784708, 242458, 40718, '<td valign="top">The technicals are excellent in this picture.  The lighting is well done.  I am not fond of the "faces" pictures, especially those which are constructed.  It doesn''t mean a 1 or a 2, but I can''t get too excited about giving them 7+.  What are we personifying here?  Just a physical characteristic?  5</td>', 'The technicals are excellent in this picture.  The lighting is well done.  I am not fond of the "faces" pictures, especially those which are constructed.  It doesn''t mean a 1 or a 2, but I can''t get too excited about giving them 7+.  What are we personifying here?  Just a physical characteristic?  5', '2005-10-14 19:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784710, 243068, 40718, '<td valign="top">A cute application of personification.  The technicals are tough.  The composition is hard to make interesting in basic editing (you can''t clone out some of the ugliness of the fridge).  I don''t like the huge black area either. 5</td>', 'A cute application of personification.  The technicals are tough.  The composition is hard to make interesting in basic editing (you can''t clone out some of the ugliness of the fridge).  I don''t like the huge black area either. 5', '2005-10-14 19:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784716, 242705, 40718, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I could have come up with the title by looking at the picture.  Afterwards, I can sorta see it, but it still isn''t obvious.  Technically, the picture could use a little saturation punch, although maybe that would take away from any "melancholy" feelings. 5</td>', 'I don''t think I could have come up with the title by looking at the picture.  Afterwards, I can sorta see it, but it still isn''t obvious.  Technically, the picture could use a little saturation punch, although maybe that would take away from any "melancholy" feelings. 5', '2005-10-14 19:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784718, 241839, 40718, '<td valign="top">A cute idea.  I think I would have rather shot it on a nonreflective surface, or one which didn''t have the grain (which I think distracts).  The focus is sharp, and that''s good.</td>', 'A cute idea.  I think I would have rather shot it on a nonreflective surface, or one which didn''t have the grain (which I think distracts).  The focus is sharp, and that''s good.', '2005-10-14 19:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1784720, 242889, 40718, '<td valign="top">A nice face, but it doesn''t do too much more for me.  Is it slightly OOF or is it motion blur?  I''m looking at the leaves above his eye.</td>', 'A nice face, but it doesn''t do too much more for me.  Is it slightly OOF or is it motion blur?  I''m looking at the leaves above his eye.', '2005-10-14 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
