(1784727, 242583, 40718, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming we are making an allusion to Van Gogh, but I can''t see it other than the swirl.  A technically well done picture.  The lighting and detail is nice.</td>', 'I''m assuming we are making an allusion to Van Gogh, but I can''t see it other than the swirl.  A technically well done picture.  The lighting and detail is nice.', '2005-10-14 19:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
