(1785025, 242207, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a statue with human attributes...?  Sorry, I was marking some images with a basic comment in case I didn''t get back to them.<br/> <br/>I like your image here - the DOF is nice with the blurred out background and the statue is very clean (neat imaged maybe?).  As for how this meets the challenge I still don''t see it as I thought the subject was to be of a non-human looking  inanimate object.  This statue is very much human looking.</td>', 'It''s a statue with human attributes...?  Sorry, I was marking some images with a basic comment in case I didn''t get back to them. I like your image here - the DOF is nice with the blurred out background and the statue is very clean (neat imaged maybe?).  As for how this meets the challenge I still don''t see it as I thought the subject was to be of a non-human looking  inanimate object.  This statue is very much human looking.', '2005-10-14 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
