(1785027, 243158, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s a statue with human attributes...?  Sorry, I was marking some images with a basic comment in case I didn''t get back to them.<br/> <br/>This is an interesting image.  A little bokeh working in the background, the statue is well focused - lighting might a little on the hot side.  As for how this meets the challenge I still don''t see it as I thought the subject was to be of a non-human looking  inanimate object.  This statue is very much human looking.</td>', 'It''s a statue with human attributes...?  Sorry, I was marking some images with a basic comment in case I didn''t get back to them. This is an interesting image.  A little bokeh working in the background, the statue is well focused - lighting might a little on the hot side.  As for how this meets the challenge I still don''t see it as I thought the subject was to be of a non-human looking  inanimate object.  This statue is very much human looking.', '2005-10-14 22:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1785029, 242107, 43191, '<td valign="top">Terific idea. I love all the different sizes and shapes and the different levels of life within the bulbs. Did it have to be a baby one that died?? This is really sad. Well done.</td>', 'Terific idea. I love all the different sizes and shapes and the different levels of life within the bulbs. Did it have to be a baby one that died?? This is really sad. Well done.', '2005-10-14 22:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
