(1785500, 243022, 30881, '<td valign="top">This definitely gives off that feeling of despair. I like the lighting on sme areas of the berries while leaving other parts in shadow. The background is good being left grey, however it needs to be much blurrier - all the twigs are very distracting and take away from the main subject. A very good shot overall</td>', 'This definitely gives off that feeling of despair. I like the lighting on sme areas of the berries while leaving other parts in shadow. The background is good being left grey, however it needs to be much blurrier - all the twigs are very distracting and take away from the main subject. A very good shot overall', '2005-10-15 08:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
