(1788147, 242177, 40718, '<td valign="top">This is getting literary, but I think the statue represents sacrifice, but doesn''t personify it.  Tough, I know.  The crop is nice, but I''d have the flag in focus.</td>', 'This is getting literary, but I think the statue represents sacrifice, but doesn''t personify it.  Tough, I know.  The crop is nice, but I''d have the flag in focus.', '2005-10-16 18:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
