(1788622, 242207, 41675, '<td valign="top">According to the challenge, personification occurs when inanimate objects are endowed with human qualities and for me, your photo of this nice sculpture does not fit the description therefore I have given it a low score</td>', 'According to the challenge, personification occurs when inanimate objects are endowed with human qualities and for me, your photo of this nice sculpture does not fit the description therefore I have given it a low score', '2005-10-16 22:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788625, 242903, 41675, '<td valign="top">Your photo is very busy and the lighting is ia bit bright. I think I understand what you were going for, but for me it misses the mark.</td>', 'Your photo is very busy and the lighting is ia bit bright. I think I understand what you were going for, but for me it misses the mark.', '2005-10-16 22:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788627, 242888, 41675, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo, but for me I don''t see the personification of your shot even with your title. Therefore I have given it a lower score.</td>', 'An interesting photo, but for me I don''t see the personification of your shot even with your title. Therefore I have given it a lower score.', '2005-10-16 22:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788634, 241002, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Criticism; just seems a slight gamma or contrast issue, not sure, especially in the stem.  Would like to have seen that fore pointed ''sword'' nice and sharp, but otherwise a creative and unique shot well suited for the Challenge.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Criticism; just seems a slight gamma or contrast issue, not sure, especially in the stem.  Would like to have seen that fore pointed ''sword'' nice and sharp, but otherwise a creative and unique shot well suited for the Challenge.', '2005-10-16 22:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788638, 240860, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - ''Good''.  Criticism; some finer lace to enhance the ''illusion'' may have made this better in my opinion, however I do like the color &amp; texture combinations you have achieved with this.  Lighting seems good, particularly given the ''shine'' of the ''subject'', was likely difficult.  Shame about the ''eroded flesh''.</td>', '8 - ''Good''.  Criticism; some finer lace to enhance the ''illusion'' may have made this better in my opinion, however I do like the color & texture combinations you have achieved with this.  Lighting seems good, particularly given the ''shine'' of the ''subject'', was likely difficult.  Shame about the ''eroded flesh''.', '2005-10-16 22:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788651, 242460, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Well done.  Criticism; perhaps the lighting, but difficult, as it seems to me you are going for a somewhat ''high key'' effect, but the ''face'' (at least I see a ''tiny'' one, not just the ''overshadowing posture'', which is perhaps all you were going for, if so apologies) in the ''living banana'' - somehow - I would like to see ''enhanced'' more, difficult, especially retaining the shadow, ''perspective'' and said ''high key'' effect.</td>', '8 - Well done.  Criticism; perhaps the lighting, but difficult, as it seems to me you are going for a somewhat ''high key'' effect, but the ''face'' (at least I see a ''tiny'' one, not just the ''overshadowing posture'', which is perhaps all you were going for, if so apologies) in the ''living banana'' - somehow - I would like to see ''enhanced'' more, difficult, especially retaining the shadow, ''perspective'' and said ''high key'' effect.', '2005-10-16 22:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788654, 243002, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Criticism; somehow, would like to have seen more depth and perhaps ''creative'' lighting.  Colors and texture are nice, just like to see both emphasized ''somehow''.  Perhaps a slightly different crop too, not sure.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Criticism; somehow, would like to have seen more depth and perhaps ''creative'' lighting.  Colors and texture are nice, just like to see both emphasized ''somehow''.  Perhaps a slightly different crop too, not sure.', '2005-10-16 22:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788658, 242940, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Like this.  Criticism; difficult I imagine given the ''placement'' of the subject and the ''depth of field'', however I would like to see the ''emperor'' more vivid, with more detail in the texture, although I realize you may lose the ''profile effect'' in doing so.  Perhaps a different crop too, depending what is above ''his forehead''.</td>', '8 - Like this.  Criticism; difficult I imagine given the ''placement'' of the subject and the ''depth of field'', however I would like to see the ''emperor'' more vivid, with more detail in the texture, although I realize you may lose the ''profile effect'' in doing so.  Perhaps a different crop too, depending what is above ''his forehead''.', '2005-10-16 22:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788664, 241373, 30669, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot.  9</td>', 'wonderful shot.  9', '2005-10-16 22:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788668, 241543, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Good and humorous, but the title is what makes it in my opinion, and while not normally a ''fan'' of ''title heavyweight'', given this Challenge, the ''text addition restrictions'', your ''subject'' and the ''emotion'' you were conveying (and did so well too) - I make an exception. Criticism; perhaps a different crop and angle.</td>', '7 - Good and humorous, but the title is what makes it in my opinion, and while not normally a ''fan'' of ''title heavyweight'', given this Challenge, the ''text addition restrictions'', your ''subject'' and the ''emotion'' you were conveying (and did so well too) - I make an exception. Criticism; perhaps a different crop and angle.', '2005-10-16 23:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788672, 242974, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this and the colors.  Criticism; the crop detracts from the potential in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Creative though.</td>', '7 - Like this and the colors.  Criticism; the crop detracts from the potential in my opinion.  Not sure on the frame.  Creative though.', '2005-10-16 23:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788678, 242609, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like this, although I see ''the dance'' more so, but just my opinion.  Criticism; not much, perhaps more detail on the ''embracers'', making them ''pop out'' more, not sure.</td>', '7 - Like this, although I see ''the dance'' more so, but just my opinion.  Criticism; not much, perhaps more detail on the ''embracers'', making them ''pop out'' more, not sure.', '2005-10-16 23:04:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788694, 242355, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe slightly different coloring/toning/contrast.  Different crop may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.</td>', '7 - Like it.  Criticism; maybe slightly different coloring/toning/contrast.  Different crop may have made this better in my opinion, not sure.', '2005-10-16 23:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788701, 242626, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Like the concept.  Criticism; seems a little ''noisy'' in parts and/or perhaps oversharpened.  Not sure on the colors/background.</td>', '7 - Like the concept.  Criticism; seems a little ''noisy'' in parts and/or perhaps oversharpened.  Not sure on the colors/background.', '2005-10-16 23:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788707, 242679, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Well executed.  Criticism; whilst the colors and lighting work well, I would like to have seen the ''blues''/background/base/etc more subtle if possible, really making the bashful banana ''pop'' out.  Not sure on the frame, maybe it helps with the ''subject'' though.</td>', '7 - Well executed.  Criticism; whilst the colors and lighting work well, I would like to have seen the ''blues''/background/base/etc more subtle if possible, really making the bashful banana ''pop'' out.  Not sure on the frame, maybe it helps with the ''subject'' though.', '2005-10-16 23:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788747, 241381, 33947, '<td valign="top">VERY NICE! GReat line and light. Love it. My favorite. 10</td>', 'VERY NICE! GReat line and light. Love it. My favorite. 10', '2005-10-16 23:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788754, 242107, 33947, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, and great idea.</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, and great idea.', '2005-10-16 23:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
