(1788839, 242814, 45021, '<td valign="top">Nicely thought out, However I would have chaged backround colour or excluded pin colour as it tends to blend into the background too much.  I also would have liked to see all of the pins in focus.  These are both small things , well done on a great shot.</td>', 'Nicely thought out, However I would have chaged backround colour or excluded pin colour as it tends to blend into the background too much.  I also would have liked to see all of the pins in focus.  These are both small things , well done on a great shot.', '2005-10-17 00:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788840, 243149, 41520, '<td valign="top">It''s funny, but a better background and different lighting may have made it more dramatic.  But it is very funny, lol</td>', 'It''s funny, but a better background and different lighting may have made it more dramatic.  But it is very funny, lol', '2005-10-17 00:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1788844, 242709, 45021, '<td valign="top">Well done captures the sense of dance perfectly.  The ribbon I feel is a bit muchand can distract from the sculptures form.</td>', 'Well done captures the sense of dance perfectly.  The ribbon I feel is a bit muchand can distract from the sculptures form.', '2005-10-17 00:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
