(1790368, 242102, 36231, '<td valign="top">Very original!  I really love this! The lights and shadow really play out the emotion here.  How in the heck did you stand those eggs up?  I hope you didn''t have to do too many shots or your whole family was eating eggs for weeks! :) Good luck!</td>', 'Very original!  I really love this! The lights and shadow really play out the emotion here.  How in the heck did you stand those eggs up?  I hope you didn''t have to do too many shots or your whole family was eating eggs for weeks! :) Good luck!', '2005-10-17 15:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1790370, 241127, 36231, '<td valign="top">This shot is awesome and powerful.  I really feel the emotion you were trying to portray.  The centered composition really works here.  The black and white with the sepia tones adds to the photo.  You did an awesome job. Good luck!</td>', 'This shot is awesome and powerful.  I really feel the emotion you were trying to portray.  The centered composition really works here.  The black and white with the sepia tones adds to the photo.  You did an awesome job. Good luck!', '2005-10-17 15:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
