(1791027, 243001, 43020, '<td valign="top">Images like this are going to open up a lot of discussion in the forum again I think.  I agree that this is personification but as the challenge was outlined, it just doesn''t fit.  Inanimate was specified - nice capture though, I love the shot!</td>', 'Images like this are going to open up a lot of discussion in the forum again I think.  I agree that this is personification but as the challenge was outlined, it just doesn''t fit.  Inanimate was specified - nice capture though, I love the shot!', '2005-10-17 21:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791031, 242882, 46056, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting and colouring is very appropriate for the mood. I would have liked to see more of the lillies, though.  They could have filled 2/3 of the frame and you would still have been able to see the background.</td>', 'I think the lighting and colouring is very appropriate for the mood. I would have liked to see more of the lillies, though.  They could have filled 2/3 of the frame and you would still have been able to see the background.', '2005-10-17 21:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
