(1791221, 243078, 43329, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to find the bottle of beer that makes the "nightlife".. perhaps the poor fellow needs a straw to really get into the swing of things? Perhaps some colour would help give more sense of excitement?</td>', 'It took me a while to find the bottle of beer that makes the "nightlife".. perhaps the poor fellow needs a straw to really get into the swing of things? Perhaps some colour would help give more sense of excitement?', '2005-10-17 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
