(1791234, 241982, 39850, '<td valign="top">5 - ''Juvenile'', but I like it.  The title carries most of the weight though in my opinion, and whilst not normally a ''fan'' of ''weighty titles'', for this Challenge, I make an exception.  Criticism; noisy/grainy(?), not sure on the colors, perhaps a diffferent crop/perspective.  Mildred facing the others may have also made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed the ''remnants'' on the fore partygoer, attention to detail (cleaning) would be better.  The lighting needs work and overall this shot has a ''snapshot'' ''feel'' to it, in my opinion, but I like the potential, just wish you gave it more ''attention''.</td>', '5 - ''Juvenile'', but I like it.  The title carries most of the weight though in my opinion, and whilst not normally a ''fan'' of ''weighty titles'', for this Challenge, I make an exception.  Criticism; noisy/grainy(?), not sure on the colors, perhaps a diffferent crop/perspective.  Mildred facing the others may have also made this better in my opinion.  Just noticed the ''remnants'' on the fore partygoer, attention to detail (cleaning) would be better.  The lighting needs work and overall this shot has a ''snapshot'' ''feel'' to it, in my opinion, but I like the potential, just wish you gave it more ''attention''.', '2005-10-17 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791240, 243003, 43329, '<td valign="top">The interest comes more from the design of the stuffed toys, and not so much from the way the photo is set up. Could you get down to eye level with the toys? Could something happen to tell a story... one of the party pouring from the teapot, or some unfortunate guest spill his tea, perhaps?</td>', 'The interest comes more from the design of the stuffed toys, and not so much from the way the photo is set up. Could you get down to eye level with the toys? Could something happen to tell a story... one of the party pouring from the teapot, or some unfortunate guest spill his tea, perhaps?', '2005-10-17 22:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791267, 243023, 39184, '<td valign="top">I actually felt sorry for that poor guy.  Nice one.</td>', 'I actually felt sorry for that poor guy.  Nice one.', '2005-10-17 23:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791497, 242416, 3214, '<td valign="top">nice minimalist work, love it.</td>', 'nice minimalist work, love it.', '2005-10-18 00:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791530, 242590, 25728, '<td valign="top">Personification exemplified. I knew a lot of people would use the lamp idea, but this was a cute way to use it that added a lot of personality too. <br/> <br/>Plus you have smooshy looking carpet, and I like smooshy carpet.</td>', 'Personification exemplified. I knew a lot of people would use the lamp idea, but this was a cute way to use it that added a lot of personality too.  Plus you have smooshy looking carpet, and I like smooshy carpet.', '2005-10-18 00:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791534, 240845, 25728, '<td valign="top">Nice use of color, though it detracts away from "personified" just a litte in that you notice the animal first, not the lamps personality. Still, one of my favorites and voting high!<br/></td>', 'Nice use of color, though it detracts away from "personified" just a litte in that you notice the animal first, not the lamps personality. Still, one of my favorites and voting high!', '2005-10-18 00:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
