(1791551, 243046, 24981, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the same thing you did when you took this shot, but I do see what appears to be a puppy''s face - 2 eyes, small nose and an open mouth and floppy ears. :) nice abstract. -- personally, I would have cropped to isolate just the cloud in the top right quarter of the pic.</td>', 'Not sure I see the same thing you did when you took this shot, but I do see what appears to be a puppy''s face - 2 eyes, small nose and an open mouth and floppy ears. :) nice abstract. -- personally, I would have cropped to isolate just the cloud in the top right quarter of the pic.', '2005-10-18 00:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791557, 243023, 30817, '<td valign="top">Well composed, exposed and thought out. Impressive theme shot.</td>', 'Well composed, exposed and thought out. Impressive theme shot.', '2005-10-18 00:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
