(1791757, 242882, 45926, '<td valign="top">i used to have flowers like these in my yard. they were awesome. i don''t know if i love the placement of the subject in this picture though. maybe if u did more of a closeup on the flowers it''d be more interesting? but that''s just my opinion. nevertheless good job!</td>', 'i used to have flowers like these in my yard. they were awesome. i don''t know if i love the placement of the subject in this picture though. maybe if u did more of a closeup on the flowers it''d be more interesting? but that''s just my opinion. nevertheless good job!', '2005-10-18 02:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
