(1791764, 243014, 45926, '<td valign="top">i love the title. :D!! i don''t think that the windowsills work for me though. maybe if you had the pumpkin in a solid colored room it''d be more interesting? that''s just my opinion. however, great way to get into the holiday spirit!</td>', 'i love the title. :D!! i don''t think that the windowsills work for me though. maybe if you had the pumpkin in a solid colored room it''d be more interesting? that''s just my opinion. however, great way to get into the holiday spirit!', '2005-10-18 02:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791768, 243078, 45926, '<td valign="top">oh my gosh is this a real armadillo?! wow! i think that the face of the woman in the background would''ve been an awesome separate picture. but in this particular picture, i thought of it as a little distracting? anyways good job.</td>', 'oh my gosh is this a real armadillo?! wow! i think that the face of the woman in the background would''ve been an awesome separate picture. but in this particular picture, i thought of it as a little distracting? anyways good job.', '2005-10-18 02:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791773, 242507, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow i really like this picture. it''s really "autumny"? ..is that even a word?.. haha, well anyways i think that this picture deserves to have a word created to describe it. i love the contrasting colors of the leaves and the water. and by the way what are those blue things? well good job!</td>', 'wow i really like this picture. it''s really "autumny"? ..is that even a word?.. haha, well anyways i think that this picture deserves to have a word created to describe it. i love the contrasting colors of the leaves and the water. and by the way what are those blue things? well good job!', '2005-10-18 02:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791777, 242888, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow this picture looks really cool. the spidery things look as if they''re reflected on the upper right side of the picture. i love it''s abstractness. i''d probably buy a print of this. i don''t really get why you called this "the big brother,"  though, but i''m sure that it''s coherent. good job!</td>', 'wow this picture looks really cool. the spidery things look as if they''re reflected on the upper right side of the picture. i love it''s abstractness. i''d probably buy a print of this. i don''t really get why you called this "the big brother,"  though, but i''m sure that it''s coherent. good job!', '2005-10-18 02:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791780, 243151, 45926, '<td valign="top">is this a light bulb shattering? hope u didn''t get hurt while taking this picture! :D! it seems to be a bit dark, but it''s still pretty cool. good job</td>', 'is this a light bulb shattering? hope u didn''t get hurt while taking this picture! :D! it seems to be a bit dark, but it''s still pretty cool. good job', '2005-10-18 02:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791793, 242814, 45926, '<td valign="top">aww! this is so cute and sad! the white pin seems to sort of blend in with the background. i find it interesting that the white pins shadow seems to be pointy despite that in actuality, it''s bent. interesting picture! good job.</td>', 'aww! this is so cute and sad! the white pin seems to sort of blend in with the background. i find it interesting that the white pins shadow seems to be pointy despite that in actuality, it''s bent. interesting picture! good job.', '2005-10-18 02:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1791803, 242460, 45926, '<td valign="top">wow, i think that this picture is really awesome. great lighting.  i thought that the scratches on the banana were a really nice touch. how did u get the banana to stand up? awesome job!</td>', 'wow, i think that this picture is really awesome. great lighting.  i thought that the scratches on the banana were a really nice touch. how did u get the banana to stand up? awesome job!', '2005-10-18 02:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
