(1791815, 242413, 45926, '<td valign="top">o are these leaves the kind that, as u said, "sleep" when u touch them? awesome. i loved playing with them when i was younger.. nice picture. the dew drop gives a nice touch. good luck!</td>', 'o are these leaves the kind that, as u said, "sleep" when u touch them? awesome. i loved playing with them when i was younger.. nice picture. the dew drop gives a nice touch. good luck!', '2005-10-18 02:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
