(1794780, 242779, 45355, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by nemesise1977:</b></div><hr/><i> horrid reflection/glare, (...) </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jhonan:</b></div><hr/><i> Pity about the reflections. </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ohthatguyagain:</b></div><hr/><i> glare a bit too much... </i></td></tr></table> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dahkota:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting.  Not sure of the glare/reflection enhances the image. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The reflection is the image :) Thanks.</td>', 'Originally posted by nemesise1977: horrid reflection/glare, (...)  Originally posted by jhonan: Pity about the reflections.  Originally posted by ohthatguyagain: glare a bit too much...  Originally posted by dahkota: Interesting.  Not sure of the glare/reflection enhances the image.   The reflection is the image :) Thanks.', '2005-10-19 05:13:48.000000', NULL, 0),
