(1795383, 241483, 44987, '<td valign="top">Hello everyone,<br/> <br/>I''m really sorry I didn''t do as highly as I was supposed to. I just entered my first challenge, and I was trying to bring out what the japanese samurai believed, that the soul of the samurai warrior lied only in his blade, and in nothing else. I am so saddenned I missed the point, again I am sorry. I don''t think I am as good as you guys and your great photos, but maybe some day I will try again. Take care everyone keep up the good work xx<br/> <br/>Nicolas</td>', 'Hello everyone, I''m really sorry I didn''t do as highly as I was supposed to. I just entered my first challenge, and I was trying to bring out what the japanese samurai believed, that the soul of the samurai warrior lied only in his blade, and in nothing else. I am so saddenned I missed the point, again I am sorry. I don''t think I am as good as you guys and your great photos, but maybe some day I will try again. Take care everyone keep up the good work xx Nicolas', '2005-10-19 12:05:56.000000', NULL, 0),
