(1796069, 242846, 42792, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the appreciative comments and the votes (good or bad).  This "face" was really just mocking me and daring me to enter this challenge.  It''s been really interesting to learn how different personification can mean to different people.  :)<br/> <br/>Re the fern leaf, yeah, agree with some of you that it''s very distracting.  This was actually my first shot and I tried several dozen others after by pushing the fern down and at different angles.  But when I uploaded to my PC, I found that the overall quality of the light and focus was really better with the first one.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the appreciative comments and the votes (good or bad).  This "face" was really just mocking me and daring me to enter this challenge.  It''s been really interesting to learn how different personification can mean to different people.  :) Re the fern leaf, yeah, agree with some of you that it''s very distracting.  This was actually my first shot and I tried several dozen others after by pushing the fern down and at different angles.  But when I uploaded to my PC, I found that the overall quality of the light and focus was really better with the first one.', '2005-10-19 17:14:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1796091, 242734, 11270, '<td valign="top">wow I love this shot, it is so human like...the background is lovely too,it doesn''t distract you from the tree it compliments it. Adding to my favourtites.</td>', 'wow I love this shot, it is so human like...the background is lovely too,it doesn''t distract you from the tree it compliments it. Adding to my favourtites.', '2005-10-19 17:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
