(1804949, 241369, 45516, '<td valign="top">Just a few comments to those who posted.  I saw this as Personification as the silhouette of a girl.  To me, this is a sexy shot of the guitar, of the hip area of a female.  To me it resembles the female body, which is what I understood as personification as (human/live resemblance).<br/> <br/>Those of you that had good things to say, I appreciate the comments.  This was not the best picture, I have one that was dated before the contest that was sooo much better.  And I had about an hour time frame before I had to catch a flight, so it was a haste submission.  Not to mention it was taken with a point and shoot.  I will have my SLR soon!<br/> <br/>You havent seen the last of me!!!<br/></td>', 'Just a few comments to those who posted.  I saw this as Personification as the silhouette of a girl.  To me, this is a sexy shot of the guitar, of the hip area of a female.  To me it resembles the female body, which is what I understood as personification as (human/live resemblance). Those of you that had good things to say, I appreciate the comments.  This was not the best picture, I have one that was dated before the contest that was sooo much better.  And I had about an hour time frame before I had to catch a flight, so it was a haste submission.  Not to mention it was taken with a point and shoot.  I will have my SLR soon! You havent seen the last of me!!!', '2005-10-23 13:56:38.000000', NULL, 0),
